## Mermaid diagram macro powered by beautiful-mermaid
##
## Admin setup (Confluence Server / Data Center):
##   1. Management → User Macros → Create User Macro
##   2. Macro name: mermaid
##   3. Macro body: Has body
##   4. Body processing: Unrendered
##   5. Output: HTML
##   6. Paste this template
##
## Replace INIT_JS_URL with your internal static server URL, e.g.:
##   https://static.example.com/confluence-beautiful-mermaid/mermaid-init.js

## @param theme:title=Theme|type=enum|enumValues=light,dark|default=light|desc=Diagram color theme

<div class="bm-mermaid-diagram" data-state="pending" data-theme="$paramtheme">
  <pre class="bm-source" style="display:none">$body</pre>
  <div class="bm-render-target" style="padding:8px 0;color:#666;font-size:13px;">Rendering diagram...</div>
</div>
<script src="INIT_JS_URL"></script>
